# Optional: browser-accessible HTTPS endpoint accepting POST JSON:
# { "name": "...", "email": "...", "subject": "...", "message": "..." }
# Return HTTP 2xx only after accepting the message for delivery.
# The endpoint must allow requests from your site's origin (CORS).
# Never place secret API keys in VITE_ variables: these are public build values.
# Default: FormSubmit emails the address in src/data/contact.js.
# First submission triggers a one-time recipient activation email.
# Confirm it in your inbox, then resubmit to verify delivery.
# Optionally override the default with your own endpoint below.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
